Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.96,0:00:04.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The game...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.96,0:00:04.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这场竞赛…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.83,0:00:07.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}they say a person either has what it takes to play
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.83,0:00:07.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们说参加的人要么有本事竞争
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.54,0:00:08.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}or they don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.54,0:00:08.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要么毫无竞争力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.33,0:00:12.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My mother was one of the greats.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.33,0:00:12.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的母亲是个中翘楚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:14.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Me, on the other hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:14.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}至于我…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.79,0:00:16.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm kind of screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.79,0:00:16.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}算是前途堪虑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.92,0:00:37.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.92,0:00:37.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.83,0:00:40.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Humiliating on so many levels.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.83,0:00:40.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}丢脸丢到家了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.71,0:00:41.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.71,0:00:41.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.88,0:00:43.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't you come back down here,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.88,0:00:43.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你何不回来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.42,0:00:45.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and we'll pick up where we left off?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.42,0:00:45.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}继续我们的未完之事？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.04,0:00:47.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, seriously. You have to go. I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.04,0:00:47.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行 我是说真的 你得走了 我迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.21,0:00:50.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Which isn't what you want to be on your first day of work, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.21,0:00:50.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}上班首日就迟到可不妙 所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.08,0:00:52.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, uh, you actually live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.08,0:00:52.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以你真的住在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.58,0:00:54.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- No. - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.58,0:00:54.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.54,0:00:57.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Yes. Kind of. - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.54,0:00:57.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 算是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.67,0:01:01.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's nice. A little dusty,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.67,0:01:01.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这里很漂亮 有点灰尘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.75,0:01:03.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}odd, but it's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.75,0:01:03.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}风格奇特 但很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.67,0:01:06.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, how do you kind of live here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.67,0:01:06.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么说你“算是”住在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.67,0:01:08.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I moved two weeks ago from Boston.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.67,0:01:08.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我两周前从波士顿搬来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.38,0:01:10.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was my mother's house. I'm selling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.38,0:01:10.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是我母亲的故居 我要卖掉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.21,0:01:11.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.21,0:01:11.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.83,0:01:12.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.83,0:01:12.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}遗憾什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.88,0:01:14.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You said "was."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.88,0:01:14.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说了“故”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.04,0:01:16.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my mother's not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.04,0:01:16.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我妈没有死
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.21,0:01:18.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's... You know what? We don't have to do the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.21,0:01:18.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她…这样吧 我们不必这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.96,0:01:21.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, we can do anything you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.96,0:01:21.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你想做什么都行
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.25,0:01:24.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, the thing, exchange the details, pretend we care.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.25,0:01:24.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是 我是说不必深谈 假装我们在乎彼此
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.21,0:01:26.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, I'm gonna go upstairs and take a shower, OK,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.21,0:01:26.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要去楼上冲个澡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.12,0:01:30.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and when I get back down here, you won't be here, so, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.12,0:01:30.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我再下楼的时候 你就不在了 所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.25,0:01:34.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Goodbye, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.25,0:01:34.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再见…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.75,0:01:38.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Derek. - Derek.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.75,0:01:38.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 德瑞克 - 德瑞克
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.58,0:01:40.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Right. Meredith. - Meredith.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.58,0:01:40.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 好 我叫梅若迪丝 - 梅若迪丝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.46,0:01:43.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Yeah. Mm-hmm. - Nice meeting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.46,0:01:43.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.31,0:01:44.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bye, Derek.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.31,0:01:44.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 幸会 - 再见 德瑞克
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.79,0:02:07.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Each of you comes here today hopeful,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.79,0:02:07.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们每个人都怀抱希望而来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.62,0:02:09.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}wanting in on the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.62,0:02:09.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}想要加入这个竞赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.25,0:02:12.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A month ago, you were in med school being taught by doctors.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.25,0:02:12.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一个月前 你们还在医学院接受医生教导
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.79,0:02:15.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Today...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.79,0:02:15.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.46,0:02:17.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}you are the doctors.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.46,0:02:17.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们就是医生了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.75,0:02:22.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The seven years you spend here as a surgical resident
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.75,0:02:22.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们在此担任外科住院医师的七年
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.29,0:02:24.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}will be the best and worst of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.29,0:02:24.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}会是毕生最美好和最痛苦的时光
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.12,0:02:26.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You will be pushed to the breaking point.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.12,0:02:26.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们将被逼到临界点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.79,0:02:30.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look around you. Say hello to your competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.79,0:02:30.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}环顾四周 向对手打声招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.79,0:02:33.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Eight of you will switch to an easier specialty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.79,0:02:33.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们之中有八人 将被调往较轻松的科室
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.46,0:02:35.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Five of you will crack under the pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.46,0:02:35.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}五人将在压力下崩溃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.29,0:02:37.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Two of you will be asked to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.29,0:02:37.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}两人将被要求离开
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.82,0:02:41.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is your starting line. This is your arena.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.82,0:02:41.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是你们的起跑线 你们的竞技场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.50,0:02:43.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How well you play,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.50,0:02:43.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们表现得如何
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.00,0:02:46.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}that's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.00,0:02:46.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}全看自己决定
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.21,0:02:48.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Like I said...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.21,0:02:48.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就像我说的…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.83,0:02:51.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.83,0:02:51.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}前途堪忧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.26,0:02:55.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}实习医生
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.33,0:03:06.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK, Martin, Robinson, Bond, Hawkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.33,0:03:06.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 好 马丁、罗宾森、邦德、霍金斯 - 邦德
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.21,0:03:11.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Only six women out of 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.21,0:03:11.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}20人里只有6名女性
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.88,0:03:14.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. I hear one of them's a model.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.88,0:03:14.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊 听说其中一人还是模特
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.29,0:03:17.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Seriously, that's gonna help with the respect thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.29,0:03:17.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说真的 那对获得尊重有帮助吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.00,0:03:21.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You're Cristina, right? - Patton, Monroe... come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.00,0:03:21.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你是克里斯廷娜 对吧？ - 派顿、蒙罗…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.92,0:03:24.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Which resident are you assigned to? I got Bailey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.92,0:03:24.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你被分派给哪位住院医师？ 我跟贝利
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.25,0:03:27.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- The Nazi? Me, too. - You got the Nazi? So did I.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.25,0:03:27.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 纳粹吗？我也是 - 你们跟纳粹？我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.71,0:03:29.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}At least we'll be tortured together, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.71,0:03:29.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}至少我们会一起受折磨 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.00,0:03:32.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm George O'Malley.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.00,0:03:32.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是乔治欧麦利
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.38,0:03:35.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, we met at the, uh, mixer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.38,0:03:35.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们在交谊会见过
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.54,0:03:36.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You had on a black dress
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.54,0:03:36.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你那天穿黑色裙装
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.71,0:03:39.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}with a slit up the side, strappy sandals and...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.71,0:03:39.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}旁边有开叉 搭配绑带凉鞋和…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.54,0:03:43.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now you think I'm gay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.54,0:03:43.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在你们认为我是同性恋了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.33,0:03:44.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- No, I'm not gay. - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.33,0:03:44.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不是同性恋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.33,0:03:47.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's... it's just that, uh, you were...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.33,0:03:47.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那只是…只是因为你…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.50,0:03:49.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You were very unforgettable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.50,0:03:49.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你让人很难忘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.71,0:03:52.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}O'Malley, Yang, Grey, Stevens.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.71,0:03:52.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}欧麦利、杨、葛蕾、史蒂文斯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.17,0:03:55.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I'm totally forgettable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.17,0:03:55.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在我绝对会被遗忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.17,0:03:57.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Bailey? - End of the hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.17,0:03:57.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 贝利在哪里？ - 走廊尽头
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.21,0:04:00.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's the Nazi?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.21,0:04:00.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就是纳粹？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.71,0:04:02.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I thought the Nazi would be a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.71,0:04:02.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我以为纳粹是男的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.92,0:04:06.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I thought the Nazi would be a Nazi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.92,0:04:06.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我以为纳粹会像是个纳粹
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.42,0:04:09.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe it's professional jealousy. Maybe she's brilliant
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.42,0:04:09.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许是嫉妒她的专业 也许她很厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.08,0:04:11.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and they call her a Nazi because they're jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.08,0:04:11.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们叫她纳粹是出自同行相忌
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.25,0:04:13.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Maybe she's nice. - Let me guess. You're the model.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.25,0:04:13.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 也许她人很好 - 你就是那个模特吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.88,0:04:17.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi, I'm Isobel Stevens, but everyone calls me Izzie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.88,0:04:17.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好 我是伊索贝儿史蒂文斯 但大家都叫我伊兹
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.62,0:04:21.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have five rules. Memorize them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.62,0:04:21.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有五个规定 记好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.92,0:04:23.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rule number one... Don't bother sucking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.92,0:04:23.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}规定一 不要拍马屁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.71,0:04:25.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I already hate you. That's not gonna change.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.71,0:04:25.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我已经讨厌你们了 那是不会改变的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.75,0:04:28.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Trauma protocol, phone list, pagers,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.75,0:04:28.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}创伤治疗程序 电话号码列表、呼叫器
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.42,0:04:30.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}nurses will page you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.42,0:04:30.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}护士会呼叫你们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.25,0:04:32.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You will answer every page at a run. A run!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.25,0:04:32.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们得迅速响应传呼 刻不容缓！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.96,0:04:34.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's rule number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.96,0:04:34.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是规定二
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.79,0:04:38.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your first shift starts now and lasts 48 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.79,0:04:38.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们从现在开始值班 时间48小时
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.54,0:04:40.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're interns, grunts, nobodies,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.54,0:04:40.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们是实习医生、无名小卒…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.49,0:04:41.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}bottom of the surgical food chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.49,0:04:41.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（第一个小时）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.45,0:04:42.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You run labs, write orders, work every second night
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.45,0:04:42.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}…位处外科食物链的最底层
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.99,0:04:45.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}until you drop, and don't complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.99,0:04:45.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们要做检验、写医嘱 两天值一次夜班
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.70,0:04:47.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}On-call rooms. Attendings hog them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.70,0:04:47.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}直到你们倒下 别抱怨
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.33,0:04:49.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sleep when you can where you can,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.33,0:04:49.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}待命室 已被主治医师霸占了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.91,0:04:52.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}which brings me to rule number three.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.91,0:04:52.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有空就赶紧睡 这就要说到规定三了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.83,0:04:54.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If I'm sleeping, don't wake me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.83,0:04:56.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}若我在睡觉 除非病人快死了 否则别叫醒我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.83,0:04:56.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}unless your patient is actually dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.92,0:04:59.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rule number four... The dying patient better not be dead when I get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.92,0:04:59.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}规则四 我赶到时 危急病患最好不要已经死了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.79,0:05:03.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not only will you have killed someone, you woke me for no reason. We clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.79,0:05:03.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}否则你们不仅害死病人 还无故把我吵醒 懂吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.96,0:05:04.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.96,0:05:04.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.96,0:05:07.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You said five rules. That was only four.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.96,0:05:07.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说有五个规定 这样总共只有四个
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.75,0:05:11.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rule number five... When I move, you move.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.75,0:05:11.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}规定五 我行动时 你们跟着行动
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.62,0:05:14.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.62,0:05:14.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让开！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.17,0:05:17.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ Hey, hey, hey ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.00,0:05:21.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ Hey, hey, hey, hey ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.12,0:05:30.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do we got?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.12,0:05:30.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么情况？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.04,0:05:32.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Katie Bryce, 15-year-old female, new onset seizures,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.04,0:05:32.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}凯蒂布莱斯 15岁女性 近期开始癫痫发作
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.96,0:05:34.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}intermittent for the past week.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.96,0:05:34.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}过去这周间歇性发病
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.88,0:05:36.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}IV lost en route,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.88,0:05:36.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}途中静脉输液无效
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.21,0:05:38.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}started grand mal seizing as we descended.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.21,0:05:38.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在我们降落时开始严重癫痫
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.67,0:05:40.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, get her on her side.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.67,0:05:40.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 让她侧躺
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.71,0:05:43.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Izzie, 10 milligrams Diazepam IM.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.71,0:05:43.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}伊兹 肌肉注射十毫克安定
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.17,0:05:46.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no. The white lead is on the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.17,0:05:46.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不对 白色电极在右边
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.33,0:05:48.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Righty, whitey, smoke over fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.33,0:05:48.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}白在右 烟在上 火在下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.46,0:05:51.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A large-bore IV. Don't let the blood hemolyze. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.46,0:05:51.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大流量输液 阻止溶血 动作快！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.17,0:05:58.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do we have? A wet fish on dry land.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.17,0:05:58.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么情况？高危险病患吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.67,0:06:00.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Absolutely, Dr. Burke.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.67,0:06:00.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错 柏克医生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.96,0:06:04.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Bailey, let's shotgun her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.96,0:06:04.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}贝利医生 替她做全检
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.33,0:06:05.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That means every test in the book...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.33,0:06:05.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}意思就是进行所有检验
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.88,0:06:08.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}CT, CBC, chem-7, tox screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.88,0:06:08.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}断层扫描、血常规 血液生化、毒理检验
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.67,0:06:11.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Cristina, you're on labs. George, patient work-ups.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.67,0:06:11.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}克里斯廷娜 你负责检验 乔治 诊断病患
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.71,0:06:13.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Meredith, get Katie for a CT.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.71,0:06:13.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}梅若迪丝 替凯蒂做断层扫描
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.67,0:06:15.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's your responsibility now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.67,0:06:15.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她现在是你的病人了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.88,0:06:17.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait. What about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.88,0:06:17.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下 那我呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.04,0:06:21.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Honey, you get to do rectal exams.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.04,0:06:21.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亲爱的 你去做直肠检查
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.04,0:06:38.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.04,0:06:38.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在这里做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.33,0:06:41.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um, Katie Bryce's labs came out clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.33,0:06:41.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}凯蒂布莱斯的检验结果没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.08,0:06:42.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's nothing in the results that explain her seizures.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.08,0:06:42.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有任何异常能解释癫痫原因
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.92,0:06:43.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just thought you would want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.92,0:06:43.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想你会要知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.88,0:06:45.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.88,0:06:45.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.04,0:06:48.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, I heard every year, the attending on-call
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.04,0:06:48.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我听说每一年 主治医师
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.08,0:06:49.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}picks the best intern and lets them
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.08,0:06:49.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}会挑选最好的实习医生并让他们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.79,0:06:52.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}perform a procedure during the first shift.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.79,0:06:52.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在首次值班时一起进行手术
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.79,0:06:58.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I'm just saying it's what I heard. - Go away... now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.79,0:06:58.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我只是这样听说的 - 离开…快点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.96,0:07:03.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Yeah, sounds good. - He'll be fine? You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.96,0:07:03.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 好了 听上去状况很好 - 他不会有事吗？你不会有事的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.08,0:07:06.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you don't count the fact that my bacon days are over, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.08,0:07:06.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但可想而知 我以后没培根吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.58,0:07:09.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So bypass surgery tomorrow with Dr. Burke. I hear he's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.58,0:07:09.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}明天柏克医生会进行动脉绕道手术 我听说他很厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.58,0:07:10.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And, after that, you can have
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.58,0:07:10.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}手术过后 你可以大吃
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.96,0:07:13.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}all the bacon-flavored soy product you can eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.96,0:07:13.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所有培根风味的豆制品
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.46,0:07:15.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mmm. Kill me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.46,0:07:15.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那现在杀了我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.04,0:07:18.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I wish I could, but I'm a healer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.04,0:07:18.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也希望可以 但我是医生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.92,0:07:22.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.92,0:07:22.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你迷路了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.25,0:07:25.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not lost. How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.25,0:07:25.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有 你感觉如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.71,0:07:27.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How do you think I'm feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.71,0:07:27.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得还能有什么感觉？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.42,0:07:30.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I'm missing my pageant. - You're missing your pageant?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.42,0:07:30.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我错过选美比赛了 - 你错过选美比赛？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.17,0:07:31.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The Spokane Teen Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.17,0:07:31.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}青少年斯波坎小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.92,0:07:34.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was in the top ten after the first two rounds.
