Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.08,0:08:06.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bet you missed a lot when you first started out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.08,0:08:06.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你刚当医生时也常找不到血管吧
