Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.50,0:08:20.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I didn't get stuck with someone this clueless,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.50,0:08:20.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当时我也没遇到像你这么蠢的人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.71,0:08:23.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and that was, like, a nurse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.71,0:08:23.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且那个人还是个护士
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.17,0:08:25.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You and I are gonna have so much fun together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.17,0:08:25.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你跟我会相处得非常愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.13,0:08:30.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（第七个小时）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.54,0:08:35.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This shift is a marathon, not a sprint.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.54,0:08:35.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}值班像是马拉松 不是短跑
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.29,0:08:36.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Eat. - I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.29,0:08:36.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 吃吧 - 我吃不下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.71,0:08:37.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You should eat something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.71,0:08:37.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你应该吃点东西
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.00,0:08:42.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You try eating after performing 17 rectal exams. The Nazi hates me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.00,0:08:42.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}做了17个直肠检查后最好吃得下 纳粹讨厌我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.33,0:08:45.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The Nazi's a resident. I have attendings hating me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.33,0:08:45.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}纳粹只是住院医师 已经有主治医师讨厌我了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.12,0:08:46.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know Meredith is inbred?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.12,0:08:46.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们知道梅若迪丝出身医家吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.83,0:08:49.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Like it's uncommon here to be a doctors' parents...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.83,0:08:49.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这里的人有医生父母很正常…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.33,0:08:51.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Royally inbred. Her mother is Ellis Grey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.33,0:08:51.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我说的是名医 她母亲是伊莉丝葛蕾
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.33,0:08:52.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Shut up. The Ellis Grey?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.33,0:08:52.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不会吧 那个伊莉丝葛蕾？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.71,0:08:55.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Who's Ellis Grey? - The Grey Method.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.71,0:08:55.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 谁是伊莉丝葛蕾？ - 葛蕾疗法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.88,0:08:57.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where'd you go to med school, Mexico?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.88,0:08:57.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是在墨西哥学医吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.25,0:08:58.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She was one of the first bi chick surgeons.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.25,0:08:58.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她是最早的顶尖女性外科医生
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.83,0:09:00.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She practically invented the...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.83,0:09:00.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她发明了…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.00,0:09:02.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's a living legend. Yeah, she won the Harper Avery twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.00,0:09:02.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她是传奇人物 两度获颁哈波艾佛瑞奖
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.92,0:09:04.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I didn't know one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.92,0:09:04.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我真是孤陋寡闻啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.38,0:09:06.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Talk about parental pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.38,0:09:06.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有这种父母压力一定很大
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.17,0:09:07.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'd kill to have Ellis Grey as a mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.17,0:09:07.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我超想要伊莉丝葛蕾这种妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.92,0:09:09.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'd kill to be Ellis Grey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.92,0:09:09.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我超想成为伊莉丝葛蕾
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.88,0:09:11.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All I need is one good case.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.88,0:09:11.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只需要一个好的病人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.38,0:09:15.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Katie Bryce is a pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.38,0:09:15.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}凯蒂布莱斯真惹人厌
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.54,0:09:17.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If I hadn't taken the Hippocratic Oath,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.54,0:09:17.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果不是我曾立誓行医济世
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.08,0:09:19.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'd Kevorkian her with my bare hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.08,0:09:19.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会徒手把她弄死
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.54,0:09:21.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.54,0:09:21.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.54,0:09:24.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good afternoon, interns.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.54,0:09:24.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}午安 实习医生们
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.04,0:09:29.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's posted, but I thought I'd share the good news personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.04,0:09:29.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}虽然已众人皆知 但我还是想来亲自分享好消息
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.33,0:09:32.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}As you know, the honor of performing the first surgery
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.33,0:09:32.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如各位所知 首次参与手术的荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.71,0:09:36.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}is reserved for the intern that shows the most promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.71,0:09:36.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}属于最有潜力的实习医生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.08,0:09:38.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}As I'm running the OR today,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.08,0:09:38.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我今天有一台手术
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.38,0:09:39.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I get to make that choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.38,0:09:39.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以由我来选择
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.12,0:09:44.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- George O'Malley. - Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.12,0:09:44.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 乔治欧麦利 - 我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.21,0:09:48.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You'll scrub in for an appendectomy this afternoon. Congratulations. Enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.21,0:09:48.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你将参与今天下午的阑尾切除手术 恭喜你 好好享受
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.42,0:09:56.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did he say me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.42,0:09:56.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他刚说我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.79,0:09:58.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've seen his file.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.79,0:09:58.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看过他的档案
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.25,0:10:00.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}George O'Malley barely made the cut to get in this program.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.25,0:10:00.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔治欧麦利是勉强进入实习名单的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.79,0:10:03.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- He's not your guy. - He's my guy, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.79,0:10:03.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 他不是你要的人 - 他就是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.08,0:10:04.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Every year, you pick your guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.08,0:10:04.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你每年都会挑自己属意的人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.79,0:10:07.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and every year, your guy suffers more than any other intern.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.79,0:10:07.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后让那个人 比其他实习生吃更多苦头
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.25,0:10:09.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Terrorize one, and the rest fall in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.25,0:10:09.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这叫杀鸡儆猴
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.42,0:10:13.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I get it, I respect it, but George O'Malley's a puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.42,0:10:13.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道 我尊重这做法 但乔治欧麦利太嫩了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.38,0:10:14.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Katie Bryce, 3604?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.38,0:10:14.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}凯蒂布莱斯 3604号房呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.92,0:10:16.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Right there. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.92,0:10:16.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 在那里 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.50,0:10:18.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Katie, honey, Mom and Dad are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.50,0:10:18.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}凯蒂 亲爱的 爸妈来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.62,0:10:20.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They gave her a sedative for the CT scan,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.62,0:10:20.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们替她打了镇静剂 好做断层扫描
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.79,0:10:22.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}so she's a little groggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.79,0:10:22.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以她有点昏沉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.42,0:10:23.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Will she be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.42,0:10:23.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她不会有事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.83,0:10:26.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Our doctor at home said that she might need an operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.83,0:10:26.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们的家庭医生说 她可能需要接受手术
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.67,0:10:27.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.67,0:10:27.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.00,0:10:29.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What kind of operation?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.00,0:10:29.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么样的手术？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.25,0:10:32.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's, um... Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.25,0:10:32.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她…这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.67,0:10:34.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what? I'm not the doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.67,0:10:34.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样吧 我不是医生
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.62,0:10:36.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um, I'm a doctor,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.62,0:10:36.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是医生
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.33,0:10:39.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but I'm not Katie's doctor, so I'll go get him for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.33,0:10:39.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我不是凯蒂的医生 我去帮你们叫他来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.83,0:10:45.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What? - Katie's parents have questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.83,0:10:45.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 干嘛？ - 凯蒂的父母有疑问
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.92,0:10:47.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you talk to them, or do I ask Burke?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.92,0:10:47.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你去跟他们谈 还是我去找柏克？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.79,0:10:49.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, Burke's off the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.79,0:10:49.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不用 这病人不归柏克管了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.29,0:10:52.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Katie belongs to the new attending now, Dr. Shepherd. He's over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.29,0:10:52.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}凯蒂现在归新来的主治医师管 薛波医生 他在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.83,0:11:11.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Meredith, can I talk to you for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.83,0:11:11.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}梅若迪丝 能跟你谈一下吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.17,0:11:12.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Actually, I was...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.17,0:11:12.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事实上 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.71,0:11:15.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Shepherd.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.71,0:11:15.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}薛波医生
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.88,0:11:19.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Shepherd? This morning, it was Derek.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.88,0:11:19.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}薛波医生？今天早上你还叫我德瑞克
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.12,0:11:20.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now it's Dr. Shepherd.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.12,0:11:20.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在就变成薛波医生了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.17,0:11:23.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Shepherd, we should pretend it never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.17,0:11:23.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}薛波医生 我们该假装事情没发生过
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.17,0:11:25.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What never happened? You sleeping with me last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.17,0:11:25.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么事情没发生过？ 是你昨晚跟我上床
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.67,0:11:27.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}or you throwing me out this morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.67,0:11:27.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还是你今天早上赶我出去？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.29,0:11:29.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Both are fond memories I'd like to hold onto.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.29,0:11:29.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为这两个美好回忆我都想记住
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.33,0:11:32.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, there will be no memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.33,0:11:32.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行 不会有什么回忆
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.21,0:11:34.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not the girl in the bar anymore, and you're not the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.21,0:11:34.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不再是酒吧里的那个女孩 你也不再是那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.12,0:11:37.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This can't exist. You get that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.12,0:11:37.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这层关系不能存在 你懂的 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.83,0:11:39.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You took advantage of me, and now you wanna forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.83,0:11:39.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你占完我便宜就想全都忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.88,0:11:41.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I did not take...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.88,0:11:41.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 没有 - 我醉到毫无防备
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.21,0:11:42.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was drunk, vulnerable and good-looking. You took advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.21,0:11:42.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}又长得帅 你就占我便宜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.83,0:11:44.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK, I was the one who was drunk,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.83,0:11:44.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了 喝醉的人是我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.38,0:11:46.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and you are not that good-looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.38,0:11:46.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且你没那么帅
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.04,0:11:47.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe not today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.04,0:11:47.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今天也许不帅
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.38,0:11:48.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Last night, I was very good-looking.
