Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.21,0:20:29.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You paged Dr. Shepherd. - I just told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.21,0:20:29.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你呼叫薛波医生了？ - 我刚说有了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.50,0:20:33.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Well, page him again, stat. - What do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.50,0:20:33.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 再呼叫他一次 马上去 - 你想怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.71,0:20:36.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Grey, you need to tell us what you want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.71,0:20:36.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}葛蕾医生 你得告诉我们你想怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.75,0:20:39.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Heart stopped. - Code blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.75,0:20:39.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 心跳停止 - 抢救警报！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.04,0:20:42.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Code blue! Code blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.04,0:20:42.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抢救警报！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.92,0:20:45.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Get the crash cart. - I'll get it, right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.92,0:20:45.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 推电击车来 - 我来推 马上来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.12,0:20:49.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.12,0:20:49.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.38,0:20:51.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Charge the pads to 200.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.38,0:20:51.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}充电到两百伏特
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.88,0:20:53.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Charge. Clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.88,0:20:53.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}充电 让开
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.08,0:20:57.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Still v-fib. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.08,0:20:57.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}仍旧心室纤维颤动 没反应
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.62,0:20:59.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Charging. - Nineteen seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.62,0:20:59.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 充电 - 急救19秒
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.75,0:21:01.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Charge them to 300.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.75,0:21:01.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}充电到三百伏特
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.29,0:21:02.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}300. Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.29,0:21:02.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}三百伏特 有反应吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.88,0:21:03.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Twenty seven seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.88,0:21:03.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}急救27秒
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.88,0:21:05.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Charge to 360.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.88,0:21:05.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}充电到360伏特
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.92,0:21:07.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, Katie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.92,0:21:07.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}加油啊 凯蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.92,0:21:09.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Forty-nine seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.92,0:21:09.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}急救49秒
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.29,0:21:10.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}At 60 seconds, you're supposed to admin another drug.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.29,0:21:10.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}60秒时你就要用另一种药了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.96,0:21:12.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Charge again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.96,0:21:12.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再充电！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.75,0:21:15.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Charge again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.75,0:21:15.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再充电
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.62,0:21:17.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.62,0:21:17.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}充电
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.92,0:21:20.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.92,0:21:20.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有反应吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.92,0:21:22.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I see sinus rhythm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.92,0:21:22.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有窦性心律了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.75,0:21:25.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Blood pressure's coming up. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.75,0:21:25.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 血压上升中 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.00,0:21:28.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pressure's returning. Rate's coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.00,0:21:28.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}血压回稳中 脉搏逐渐恢复
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.96,0:21:30.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.96,0:21:30.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}发生什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.33,0:21:32.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- She had a seizure and her heart stopped. - Seizure?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.33,0:21:32.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 她癫痫发作 心跳停止了 - 癫痫？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.29,0:21:34.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You're supposed to be monitoring. - I checked on her and she...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.29,0:21:34.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你应该监控她的 - 我来看过她
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.83,0:21:36.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I got her. Just... just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.83,0:21:36.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我来接手 你走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.96,0:21:41.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Somebody give me her...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.96,0:21:41.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁去拿她的…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.79,0:21:43.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Give me her chart, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.79,0:21:43.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请给我她的病历
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.46,0:21:45.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You get a 911, you page me immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.46,0:21:45.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}收到紧急呼叫 就要马上呼叫我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.92,0:21:48.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not in the five minutes it takes you to get to the emergency. Immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.92,0:21:48.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是花五分钟才赶来急救 要马上到
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.96,0:21:52.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're on my team and if somebody dies, it's my ass. Do you hear me? Grey?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.96,0:21:52.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是我带的 人死了会算在我头上 听到了吗 葛蕾？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.29,0:21:55.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Meredith?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.29,0:21:55.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}梅若迪丝？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.29,0:22:03.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ Rise up off the ground Where you lay ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.62,0:22:06.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ You've been Laying there so long ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.46,0:22:11.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ You just about have forgotten How to live your life ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.50,0:22:14.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ Well, you can't find where you belong ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.50,0:22:17.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ No, you can't find where you fit in ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.12,0:22:19.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you tell anyone, ever...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.12,0:22:19.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}绝对不准告诉任何人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.04,0:22:24.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ Give your life a chance again ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.04,0:22:24.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（第24个小时）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.12,0:22:27.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ You're ready to rise ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.00,0:22:30.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ You're ready to rise ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.00,0:22:33.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You said it was a seizure disorder.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.00,0:22:33.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你曾说是癫痫发作
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.62,0:22:36.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Now you're saying it isn't? - I'm saying that I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.62,0:22:36.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 现在你又说不是？ - 我是说我不确定
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.17,0:22:38.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What do you think it could be? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.17,0:22:38.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你认为会是什么病？ - 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.33,0:22:40.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- When will you know? - I don't have an answer for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.33,0:22:40.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你何时会知道？ - 我没有确定答案
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.79,0:22:44.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- For now, Katie is stable, and... - Wait one damn minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.79,0:22:44.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 凯蒂目前情况稳定 而… - 给我等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.17,0:22:47.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We came here because this hospital
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.17,0:22:47.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们来此就医是因为这间医院
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.08,0:22:49.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}is supposed to be the best in Washington.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.08,0:22:49.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}应该是华盛顿最好的医院
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.33,0:22:53.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's my kid in there. My kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.33,0:22:53.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是我的孩子啊 我的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.38,0:22:55.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you have the audacity to stand here and tell me, "I don't know."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.38,0:22:55.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你竟然有脸站在这里 告诉我：“我不知道”
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.71,0:22:56.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mr. Bryce...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.71,0:22:56.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}布莱斯先生…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.71,0:23:00.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I want someone else, a doctor who knows what they're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.71,0:23:00.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不用说了 我要其他真正专业的医生来治
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.04,0:23:02.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You get me someone else, someone better than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.04,0:23:02.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你去替我找其他人 比你厉害的人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.67,0:23:04.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mr. Bryce, I assure you. I am working hard on Katie's case.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.67,0:23:04.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}布莱斯先生 我保证我很努力在治疗凯蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.71,0:23:08.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, you're not. If you were, you'd be able to give me some answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.71,0:23:08.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你没有 若真是那样 你就能给我答案了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.00,0:23:12.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I put you on a bypass machine, which pumps blood for your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.00,0:23:12.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我将你接上绕道机 为你的心脏抽送血液
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.33,0:23:16.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fix your ticker, take you off the machine. I'm done. Simple procedure.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.33,0:23:16.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}修补你的心脏 卸除机器 完成手术 程序很简单
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.88,0:23:18.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I shouldn't worry?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.88,0:23:18.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我不必担心？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.04,0:23:20.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm very good at what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.04,0:23:20.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很擅长外科手术
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.08,0:23:22.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It still is surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.08,0:23:22.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但这毕竟是手术
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.21,0:23:23.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There are some risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.21,0:23:23.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还是有一些风险
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.71,0:23:25.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll see you in the OR this afternoon, Mr. Savitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.71,0:23:25.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们下午在手术室见 沙维奇先生
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.32,0:23:27.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.88,0:23:31.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're not gonna leave me alone with that guy, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.88,0:23:31.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不会把我丢给那家伙吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.12,0:23:35.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I'll be outside the OR the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.12,0:23:35.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}从头到尾我都会在手术室外
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.71,0:23:38.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, Dr. Burke is very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.71,0:23:38.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没事的 柏克医生很厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.42,0:23:39.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.42,0:23:39.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别担心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.08,0:23:41.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll see you after.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.08,0:23:41.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}手术后再见
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.29,0:23:42.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He'll be fine, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.29,0:23:42.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他不会有事 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.75,0:23:44.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tony's gonna sail through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.75,0:23:44.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}东尼的手术会很顺利的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.08,0:23:49.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have nothing to worry about. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.08,0:23:49.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们不需要担心 我保证
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.79,0:23:52.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.79,0:23:52.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.58,0:23:56.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What are you doing? - I'm suturing a banana
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.58,0:23:56.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你在做什么？ - 缝合香蕉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.25,0:23:58.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}with the vain hope that it wakes up my brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.25,0:23:58.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}痴心妄想这能让我的脑袋清醒
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.75,0:24:01.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you smiling at, 007?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.75,0:24:01.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在笑什么 007？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.71,0:24:04.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry. I get mean when I 'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.71,0:24:04.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉 我累了就会很毒舌
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.58,0:24:07.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what? I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.58,0:24:07.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老实说 我不在乎
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.92,0:24:10.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I comforted a family, and I got to hang out in the OR today.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.92,0:24:10.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我安抚了一个家庭 今天还能进手术室
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.12,0:24:12.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All is well.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.12,0:24:12.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一切都很美好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.17,0:24:13.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Does anybody know why we're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.17,0:24:13.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有人知道我们为何来此吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.17,0:24:15.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.17,0:24:15.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.92,0:24:16.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Morning. - Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.92,0:24:16.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 早上好 - 早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.96,0:24:19.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm gonna do something pretty rare for a surgeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.96,0:24:19.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要做一件外科医生很少做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.33,0:24:21.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm gonna ask interns for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.33,0:24:21.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要寻求实习医生的帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.79,0:24:23.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've got this kid, Katie Bryce.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.79,0:24:23.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有个年轻病人 凯蒂布莱斯
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.42,0:24:25.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Right now, she's a mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.42,0:24:25.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}目前她的病因不明
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.58,0:24:28.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She doesn't respond to our meds.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.58,0:24:28.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们的治疗对她无效
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.12,0:24:30.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Labs are clean, scans are pure,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.12,0:24:30.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}检验和扫描结果都正常
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.50,0:24:33.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but she's having seizures, grand mal seizures with no visible cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.50,0:24:33.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但她癫痫发作 没有明确原因地严重癫痫
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.67,0:24:36.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's a ticking clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.67,0:24:36.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她的时间不多了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.25,0:24:39.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's gonna die if I don't make a diagnosis, which is where you come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.25,0:24:39.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}若我无法确诊 她会死亡 这时需要你们帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.17,0:24:41.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't do it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.17,0:24:41.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我无法独力解决
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.96,0:24:44.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I need your extra minds, extra eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.96,0:24:44.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我需要你们脑力激荡 集思广益
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.46,0:24:47.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I need you to play detective. I need you to find out why Katie's having seizures.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.46,0:24:47.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我需要你们扮演侦探 查出凯蒂为何癫痫
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.67,0:24:51.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know you're tired. You busy, you got more work than you could possibly handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.67,0:24:51.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道你们很累 工作量超出负荷
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.33,0:24:55.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I understand. So I'm gonna give you an incentive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.33,0:24:55.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我理解 所以我会给你们一个奖励
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.79,0:24:58.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Whoever finds the answer rides with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.79,0:24:58.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}找出答案的人能与我一起做手术
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.67,0:25:00.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Katie needs surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.67,0:25:00.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}凯蒂需要接受手术
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.79,0:25:02.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You get to do what no interns get to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.79,0:25:02.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们将能做实习医生无法做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.38,0:25:04.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Scrub in to assist on an advanced procedure.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.38,0:25:04.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}进手术室协助这次高级手术
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.46,0:25:07.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Bailey's gonna hand you Katie's chart.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.46,0:25:07.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}贝利医生会给你们凯蒂的病历
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.29,0:25:08.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The clock is ticking fast, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.29,0:25:08.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}时间不多了 各位
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.29,0:25:11.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If we're gonna save Katie's life, we have to do it soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.29,0:25:11.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我们要救凯蒂一命 必须尽快
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.21,0:25:19.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you just page me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.21,0:25:19.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你刚呼叫我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.33,0:25:21.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes. 4-B's still short of breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.33,0:25:21.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 4B的病人仍喘不过气
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.50,0:25:23.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Give the antibiotics time to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.50,0:25:23.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给抗生素一点时间生效
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.33,0:25:25.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The antibiotics should have worked by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.33,0:25:25.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抗生素现在应该有效果了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.33,0:25:27.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's old. She's freaking ancient.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.33,0:25:27.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她老了 年纪那么大
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.33,0:25:29.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's lucky she's still breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.33,0:25:29.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还在呼吸就很走运了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.71,0:25:31.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I got a shot to scrub in downstairs
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.71,0:25:31.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有机会到楼下参加手术
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.54,0:25:33.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}on a patient who wasn't alive during the Civil War.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.54,0:25:33.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}治疗一个没经历过南北内战的病人
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.96,0:25:35.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't page me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.96,0:25:35.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不要再呼叫我了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.00,0:25:40.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pain Management to 209. Pain Management to 209.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.00,0:25:40.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}疼痛治疗师请到209号病房
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.54,0:25:42.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, I want in on Shepherd's surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.54,0:25:42.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿 我想参与薛波的手术
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.50,0:25:45.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You've been the intern on Katie since the start. You want to work together?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.50,0:25:45.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你从一开始就是负责凯蒂的实习医生 要不要合作？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.42,0:25:47.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If we find the answer, we have a 50-50 chance of scrubbing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.42,0:25:47.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}找出答案 我们各有一半机会参与手术
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.92,0:25:50.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll work with you, but I don't want in on the surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.92,0:25:50.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我跟你合作 但我不想参与手术
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.04,0:25:51.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You can have it. - You kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.04,0:25:51.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你去吧 - 你在说笑吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.54,0:25:53.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's the biggest opportunity any intern will ever get.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.54,0:25:53.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是实习医生所能得到最重要的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.42,0:25:55.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't want to spend more time with Shepherd than I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.42,0:25:55.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没必要的话 我不想再与薛波相处
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.67,0:25:56.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do you have against Shepherd?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.67,0:25:56.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你对薛波有什么意见？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.92,0:25:58.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If we find the answer, the surgery's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.92,0:25:58.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}若我们找出答案 你去参与手术
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.75,0:26:01.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Do you want to work together or not? - Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.75,0:26:01.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你到底要不要合作？ - 说定了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.75,0:26:05.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So she doesn't have anoxia, chronic renal failure or acidosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.75,0:26:05.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她没有缺氧症 慢性肾功能衰竭或酸中毒
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.17,0:26:07.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's not a tumor, because her CT's clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.17,0:26:07.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也不是长肿瘤 她的断层扫描正常
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.08,0:26:10.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're not gonna tell me why you won't work with Shepherd?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.08,0:26:10.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真的不告诉我 为何你不想与薛波共事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.54,0:26:12.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. What about infection?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.54,0:26:12.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错 那感染呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.38,0:26:13.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, there's no white count.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.38,0:26:13.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有 白血球数量正常
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.92,0:26:16.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She has no CT lesions, no fevers,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.92,0:26:16.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她的器官没有病变、没有发烧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.42,0:26:17.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}nothing in her spinal tap.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.42,0:26:18.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}脊椎穿刺检查也正常 快告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.58,0:26:18.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.46,0:26:23.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can't comment, make a face or react in any way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.46,0:26:23.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不能评论、有怪表情 或以任何方式做反应
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.62,0:26:27.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We had sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.62,0:26:27.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们上过床
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.71,0:26:32.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What about an aneurysm?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.71,0:26:32.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那动脉瘤呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.54,0:26:34.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No blood on the CT and no headaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.54,0:26:34.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}断层扫描未显示出血 没有头痛症状
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.46,0:26:39.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK. There's no drug use, no pregnancy, no trauma.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.46,0:26:39.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 没有滥用药物、怀孕和外伤
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.42,0:26:42.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Was he good?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.42,0:26:42.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他厉害吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.88,0:26:45.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, he looks like he'd be good. Was it any good?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.88,0:26:45.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他看上去挺猛的 真的很厉害吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.79,0:26:49.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're out of answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.79,0:26:49.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们想不到答案了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.08,0:26:52.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What if no one comes up with anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.08,0:26:52.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}若大家都想不到呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.58,0:26:53.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You mean, what if she dies?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.58,0:26:53.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是说如果她死了？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.96,0:26:55.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.96,0:26:55.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.50,0:26:57.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is gonna sound really bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.50,0:27:00.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}虽然听来很冷血 但我真的很想参与手术
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.92,0:27:00.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but I really wanted that surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.79,0:27:04.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's never gonna get the chance to turn into a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.79,0:27:04.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她永远没有机会长大成人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.50,0:27:09.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The sum total of her existence will be almost winning Miss Teen whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.50,0:27:09.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}此生的意义就只是 差一点成为青少年选美冠军之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.62,0:27:13.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what her pageant talent is?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.62,0:27:13.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道她表演什么才艺吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.29,0:27:14.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They have talent?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.29,0:27:14.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她们有才艺？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.12,0:27:16.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rhythmic gymnastics.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.12,0:27:16.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}韵律体操
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.00,0:27:19.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.00,0:27:19.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.46,0:27:21.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What is rhythmic gymnastics?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.46,0:27:21.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}韵律体操到底是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.25,0:27:23.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know. I can't even say it. I don't know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.25,0:27:23.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我连念都念不好 真不懂是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.79,0:27:29.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think it's something with a ball and a...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.79,0:27:29.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想是拿一颗球和…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.17,0:27:32.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.17,0:27:32.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.25,0:27:34.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Meredith, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.25,0:27:34.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}梅若迪丝 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.79,0:27:36.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Get up. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.79,0:27:36.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快起来 走了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.92,0:27:40.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The only thing that she would possibly need is an angiogram.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.92,0:27:40.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们可能只要做血管造影就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.38,0:27:43.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. Oh, Dr. Shepherd, just one moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.38,0:27:43.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}薛波医生 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.62,0:27:45.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Katie competes in beauty pageants.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.62,0:27:45.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}凯蒂是选美比赛佳丽
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.12,0:27:47.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know that, but we have to save her life anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.12,0:27:47.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道 但我们还是要救她的命
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.12,0:27:50.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK. She has no headaches, no neck pain, her CT is clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.12,0:27:50.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她没有头痛、颈痛 断层扫描正常
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.17,0:27:52.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- There's no medical proof of an aneurysm. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.17,0:27:52.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有罹患动脉瘤的医学证据
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.34,0:27:53.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But what if she has an aneurysm anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.34,0:27:53.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.26,0:27:54.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There are no indicators.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.26,0:27:54.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但若她真的有动脉瘤呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.97,0:27:56.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She twisted her ankle a few weeks ago when she was practicing for the pageant.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.97,0:27:56.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有症状显示如此
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.30,0:27:58.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Look, I appreciate you trying to help... - She fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.30,0:27:58.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她几周前在练习才艺表演时扭伤脚踝
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.97,0:28:02.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When she twisted her ankle, she fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.97,0:28:00.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 感谢你们试图帮忙… - 她跌倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.64,0:28:02.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她扭伤脚踝时跌倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.04,0:28:05.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was no big deal, not even a bump on the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.04,0:28:05.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没什么大碍 头甚至没肿起来
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.21,0:28:07.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She got up, iced her ankle, and everything was fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.21,0:28:07.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她站起来 冰敷脚踝 一切都没事
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.83,0:28:10.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was a fall so minor, her doctor didn't even think to mention it
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.83,0:28:10.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那次跌倒轻微到 她的医生在我寻问病史时
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.33,0:28:13.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}when I was taking her history, but she did fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.33,0:28:13.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}甚至没想到要提起 但她确实曾跌倒
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.67,0:28:15.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what the chance is that a minor fall could burst an aneurysm?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.67,0:28:15.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们知道动脉瘤 因轻微跌倒破裂的机率吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.96,0:28:17.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}One in a million, literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.96,0:28:17.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是百万分之一 真的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.04,0:28:21.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Surgical scheduling is now posted.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.88,0:28:27.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Let's go. - Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.88,0:28:27.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 走吧 - 去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.50,0:28:29.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}To find out if Katie's one in a million.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.50,0:28:29.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}查明凯蒂是不是那百万分之一
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.21,0:28:48.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll be damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.21,0:28:48.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的老天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.17,0:28:50.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.17,0:28:50.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.71,0:28:54.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's minute, but it's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.71,0:28:54.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很小 但确实存在
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.71,0:28:57.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a subarachnoid hemorrhage.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.71,0:28:57.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是蜘蛛网膜下腔出血
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.71,0:29:00.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's bleeding into her brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.71,0:29:00.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她的颅内正在出血
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.92,0:29:08.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She could have gone through her entire life without it ever being a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.92,0:29:08.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她有可能一辈子都过得安然无恙
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.92,0:29:10.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- One tap in the right spot... - It exploded.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.92,0:29:10.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 但轻轻撞击该点… - 就破裂了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.75,0:29:12.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Exactly. Now I can fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.75,0:29:12.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错 现在我能修复了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.75,0:29:14.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You two did great work.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.75,0:29:14.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们两个做得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.62,0:29:17.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Love to stay, kiss your ass but I got to tell Katie's parents she's having surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.62,0:29:17.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很乐意多赞美几句 但我得告诉凯蒂的父母要动手术
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.75,0:29:19.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Katie Bryce's chart, please. - Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.75,0:29:19.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 请给我凯蒂布莱斯的病历 - 在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.42,0:29:25.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Shepherd, you'd said that you'd pick someone to scrub in if we helped?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.42,0:29:25.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}薛波医生 你说若我们帮上忙 会选一位参与手术
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.54,0:29:27.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yes, right. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.54,0:29:27.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.29,0:29:30.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry I can't take you both. It's gonna be a full house.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.29,0:29:30.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉无法选你们两位 手术室会满员
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.04,0:29:31.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Meredith, I'll see you in OR.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.04,0:29:31.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}梅若迪丝 手术室见
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.62,0:29:40.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.62,0:29:40.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.58,0:29:50.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Cristina...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.58,0:29:50.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}克里斯廷娜
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.46,0:29:53.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ When it doesn't rain It snows ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.62,0:29:58.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ Yeah, the cookie crumbles But in whose hand? ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.79,0:30:02.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ All things said and all things done ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.96,0:30:05.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ Life is short ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.46,0:30:09.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ Oh, I am young ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.17,0:30:11.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ But I have aged ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.83,0:30:16.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ Waited long to seize the day ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.58,0:30:20.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ All things said and plenty done ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.92,0:30:22.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ Life's too short ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.92,0:30:24.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ Oh-oh ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.46,0:30:26.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ Could this be? ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.33,0:30:29.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ Oh-oh ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.67,0:30:35.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ Could this be the day I've waited for? ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.38,0:30:42.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ Another door to peek in through ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.79,0:30:44.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ The floor is filthy ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.00,0:30:47.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ But the couch is clean ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.33,0:30:49.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ At the end of the day ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.33,0:30:51.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ That's another day gone ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.67,0:30:53.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ Life is short ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.21,0:30:54.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow, that was quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.21,0:30:54.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这么快就完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.33,0:30:56.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}His heart had too much damage for a bypass.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.33,0:30:56.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他的心脏受损太严重 无法做绕道手术
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.88,0:30:59.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I had to let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.88,0:30:59.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我必须放手让他走
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.33,0:31:03.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It happens, rarely, but it does happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.33,0:31:03.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这种事难免 很少见 但难免会发生
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.17,0:31:04.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The worst part of the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.17,0:31:04.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是最坏的状况
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.83,0:31:09.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I told his wife...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.83,0:31:09.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我告诉他的妻子…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.38,0:31:11.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I told Gloria that he would be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.38,0:31:11.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我告诉葛洛莉亚他不会有事
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.38,0:31:15.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I promised her that... - You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.38,0:31:15.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我向她保证… - 你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.54,0:31:17.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- They have four little girls. - I don't want you to promise anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.54,0:31:17.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 他们有四个幼女 - 不准保证任何事
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.50,0:31:20.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is my case. Did you hear me promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.50,0:31:20.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是我的病人 你听到我做保证了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.38,0:31:23.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The only one that can keep a promise like that is God,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.38,0:31:23.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}唯一能做那种保证的是上帝
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.42,0:31:25.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and I haven't seen him holding a scalpel lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.42,0:31:25.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可没见过他执刀动手术
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.58,0:31:28.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You never promise a patient's family a good outcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.58,0:31:28.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}绝对不能向病患家属保证有好结果！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.71,0:31:31.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.71,0:31:31.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我以为…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.04,0:31:33.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You important enough to promises to Mrs. Savitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.04,0:31:33.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你自认重要到能给沙维奇太太保证？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.83,0:31:36.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You get to be the one to tell her that she's a widow.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.83,0:31:36.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你去告知 她成为寡妇了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.04,0:31:37.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ Waited long to seize the day ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.17,0:31:44.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ All things said And plenty done ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.75,0:31:46.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}♪ Life is short ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.25,0:31:49.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Izzie.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.25,0:31:49.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}伊兹
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.42,0:31:54.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Maybe Meredith couldn't... - Izzie.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.42,0:31:54.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 也许梅若迪丝无法… - 伊兹
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.25,0:32:00.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll tell him I changed my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.25,0:32:00.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会跟他说我改变主意了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.88,0:32:03.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, don't do me any favors. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.88,0:32:03.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别假装帮我 没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.12,0:32:05.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Cristina...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.12,0:32:05.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}克里斯廷娜
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.08,0:32:06.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, you did a cutthroat thing. Deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.08,0:32:06.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}既然不择手段抢到了 就承担吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.08,0:32:09.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't come to me for absolution. You want to be a shark, be a shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.08,0:32:09.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别来找我原谅你 耍手段就耍到底
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.29,0:32:12.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I'm not... - Oh, yes, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.29,0:32:12.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我没有… - 你就有
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.62,0:32:15.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Only it makes you feel all bad in your warm, gooey places.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.62,0:32:15.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你只是一时觉得良心不安
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.79,0:32:18.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, screw you. I don't get picked for surgeries
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.79,0:32:18.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不对 去你的 我没有因为跟上司上床
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.12,0:32:19.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}'cause I slept with my boss,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.12,0:32:19.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}获选去做手术
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.42,0:32:21.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and I didn't get into med school 'cause I have a famous mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.42,0:32:21.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也没有靠名人老妈考上医学院
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.54,0:32:23.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Some of us have to earn what we get.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.54,0:32:23.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们有些人是得靠实力争取的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.50,0:32:35.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Mayes to ICU. Dr. Mayes, report to ICU.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.50,0:32:35.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}梅斯医生请到重症监护室
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.08,0:32:39.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Gloria, there were complications in the surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.08,0:32:39.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}葛洛莉亚 手术出了些状况
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.08,0:32:43.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tony's heart had a lot of damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.08,0:32:43.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}东尼的心脏损伤严重
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.62,0:32:48.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We tried to take him off bypass, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.62,0:32:48.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们试着替他做绕道手术 但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.00,0:32:53.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}there wasn't anything we could have done.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.00,0:32:53.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们已尽了最大努力
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.79,0:32:57.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you talking about?
