Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.42,0:32:59.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.42,0:32:59.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.62,0:33:02.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tony died.
