Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.12,0:33:04.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.12,0:33:04.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他死了
