Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.17,0:33:07.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}葛洛莉亚…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.79,0:33:09.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I am so sorry. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.79,0:33:09.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我很遗憾 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.83,0:33:16.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.83,0:33:16.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请你…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.21,0:33:19.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.21,0:33:19.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}走开
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.98,0:33:42.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（第40个小时）
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.17,0:33:50.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I promised I'd make her look cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.17,0:33:50.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我保证会帮她剃得很酷
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.17,0:33:53.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Apparently, being a bald beauty queen is the worst thing
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.17,0:33:53.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当个光头选美佳丽显然是
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.21,0:33:55.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}that happened in the history of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.21,0:33:55.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有史以来最糟的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.38,0:34:00.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you choose me for the surgery because I slept with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.38,0:34:00.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是因为我跟你上床 才选我参与手术吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.00,0:34:02.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.00,0:34:02.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.71,0:34:05.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.71,0:34:05.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}开玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.83,0:34:08.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not gonna scrub in for surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.83,0:34:08.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不会参与这次手术的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.75,0:34:10.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You should ask Cristina. She really wants it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.75,0:34:10.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你该找克里斯廷娜 她真的很想做
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.54,0:34:11.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're Katie's doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.54,0:34:11.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是凯蒂的医生
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.21,0:34:13.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And on your first day,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.21,0:34:13.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且在实习首日
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.50,0:34:15.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}with very little training, you helped save her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.50,0:34:15.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}受训不多的情况下 就协助救了她的命
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.83,0:34:19.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You earned the right to follow her case through to the finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.83,0:34:19.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}从头到尾追踪她病况的权利 是你挣得的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.54,0:34:22.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You shouldn't let the fact that we had sex
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.54,0:34:22.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不该让我们上过床的事
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.54,0:34:24.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}get in the way of you taking your shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.54,0:34:24.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}阻碍你把握这次机会
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.58,0:34:40.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I wish I wanted to be a chef
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.58,0:34:40.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真希望自己想当一名厨师
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.96,0:34:44.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}or a ski instructor or a kindergarten teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.96,0:34:44.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}滑雪教练或幼儿园老师
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.21,0:34:47.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, I would have been a really good postal worker.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.21,0:34:47.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有可能会是一名很好的邮政人员
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.92,0:34:50.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm dependable.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.92,0:34:50.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很可靠
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.21,0:34:54.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, my parents tell everyone they meet
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.21,0:34:54.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的父母逢人就说
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.46,0:34:55.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}that their son's a surgeon,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.46,0:34:55.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们的儿子是外科医生
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.21,0:34:58.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}as if it's a big accomplishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.21,0:34:58.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当那是莫大成就似的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.08,0:35:01.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Superhero or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.08,0:35:01.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是超级英雄之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.46,0:35:05.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If they could see me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.46,0:35:05.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哪知道我这么狼狈
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.21,0:35:11.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When I told my mother I wanted to go to medical school,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.21,0:35:11.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当我告诉我妈 我要念医学院
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.79,0:35:13.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}she tried to talk me out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.79,0:35:13.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她劝我打消念头
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.08,0:35:17.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Said I didn't have what it takes to be a surgeon,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.08,0:35:17.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她说我没有成为外科医生的特质
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.25,0:35:19.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}that I'd never make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.25,0:35:19.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我绝对不会成功
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.83,0:35:23.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So the way I see it,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.83,0:35:23.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以就我看来
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.25,0:35:25.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}superhero sounds pretty damn good.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.25,0:35:25.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}被当成超级英雄是很爽的事
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.96,0:35:31.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're gonna survive this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.96,0:35:31.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们会撑过去的 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.17,0:35:40.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's still short of breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.17,0:35:40.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她还是喘不过气
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.46,0:35:42.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you get an ABG or a chest film?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.46,0:35:42.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有做动脉血液气体分析或胸片吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.29,0:35:43.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yes, sir, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.29,0:35:43.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有 先生 我做了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.33,0:35:44.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And what did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.33,0:35:44.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你观察到什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.29,0:35:47.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, well, I had a lot of patients last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.29,0:35:47.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我昨晚有很多病人
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.58,0:35:49.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Name the common causes of post-op fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.58,0:35:49.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说出造成术后发烧的常见原因
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.83,0:35:51.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.83,0:35:51.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.17,0:35:53.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}From your head, not from a book.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.17,0:35:53.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}直接告诉我 不是查书
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.29,0:35:55.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't look it up. Learn it. It should be in your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.29,0:35:55.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别查书 记起来 你应该记住的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.46,0:35:57.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Name the common causes of post-op fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.46,0:35:57.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说出造成术后发烧的常见原因
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.75,0:36:01.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh... the common causes of post...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.75,0:36:01.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}常见的术后…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.46,0:36:05.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can anybody name the common causes of post-op fever?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.46,0:36:05.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁能告诉我 造成术后发烧的常见原因？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.88,0:36:10.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wind, water, wound, walking, wonder drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.88,0:36:10.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}通风、水路、伤口、走动、药物
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.71,0:36:12.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The five W's.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.71,0:36:12.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}五大原因
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.33,0:36:15.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Most of the time, it's wind, splinting or pneumonia.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.33,0:36:15.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}多数时候是通风 肺不张或肺炎
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.88,0:36:18.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pneumonia's easy to assume,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.88,0:36:18.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很容易判定是肺炎
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.67,0:36:21.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}especially if you're too busy to do the tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.67,0:36:21.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}尤其是忙到没时间做检验时
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.46,0:36:28.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do you think's wrong with 4-B?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.46,0:36:28.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你认为4B的病人怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.50,0:36:30.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The fourth W, walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.50,0:36:30.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}第四个原因 走动
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.12,0:36:32.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think she's a prime candidate for a pulmonary embolus.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.12,0:36:32.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我认为她很可能罹患肺动脉栓塞
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.50,0:36:34.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How would you diagnose?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.50,0:36:34.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如何确诊？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.46,0:36:38.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Spiral CT, V/Q scan,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.46,0:36:38.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}做螺旋式断层扫描、灌注与通气扫描
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.96,0:36:41.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}provide O2, dose with heparin
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.96,0:36:41.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给予氧气、注射肝素
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.83,0:36:44.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and consult for an IVC filter.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.83,0:36:44.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}考虑安装下腔静脉过滤器
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.54,0:36:47.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do exactly as she says,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.54,0:36:47.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}照她说的做
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.08,0:36:49.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}then tell your resident that I want you off this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.08,0:36:49.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后告诉你的住院医师 我要你停止负责这个病人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.25,0:36:54.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'd know you anywhere. You're the spitting image of your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.25,0:36:54.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好认了 你完全有令堂的风范
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.54,0:36:56.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Welcome to the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.54,0:36:56.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}欢迎加入这场竞赛
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.67,0:37:18.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, everybody. It's a beautiful night to save lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.67,0:37:18.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了 各位 这是个救人性命的美好夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.21,0:37:19.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's have some fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.21,0:37:19.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们开心享受吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.08,0:37:32.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't think of any one reason why I want to be a surgeon...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.08,0:37:32.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想不到任何一个 我为何想当外科医生的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.58,0:37:37.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but I can think of 1,000 reasons why I should quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.58,0:37:37.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我能想到一千个我该放弃的理由
