Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.46,0:37:54.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They make it hard on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.46,0:37:54.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们故意设下重重阻碍
