Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.33,0:38:13.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}到了某个时刻 一切不再只是竞赛
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.79,0:38:27.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and you either take that step forward
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.79,0:38:27.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你必须选择迈步前进
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.42,0:38:30.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}or turn around and walk away.
